{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.bc.edu/Daniel Bowles longlisted for International Booker Prize.txt"},"lines":{"text":"The English-language version of Christian Kracht's novel Eurotrash—translated from its original German by Associate Professor of German Studies Daniel Bowles—has been longlisted for the 2025 International Booker Prize. The annual prize, split equally between author and translator, recognizes fiction from around the world that has been translated into English and published in the United Kingdom and/or Ireland.\n"},"line_number":8,"absolute_offset":208,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":195,"end":221}]}}
{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.bc.edu/Daniel Bowles longlisted for International Booker Prize.txt"},"lines":{"text":"This is the first time Bowles, a scholar and translator of German-language fiction and nonfiction, has been named to the International Booker Prize longlist. He previously was awarded the Goethe-Institut's Helen & Kurt Wolff Translator's Prize for his 2015 translation of another Kracht novel, Imperium. He also is the author of the book, The Ends of Satire: Legacies of Satire in Postwar German Writing.\n"},"line_number":12,"absolute_offset":948,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":121,"end":147}]}}
{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.bc.edu/Daniel Bowles longlisted for International Booker Prize.txt"},"lines":{"text":"The six-book International Booker Prize shortlist will be released on April 8, and the winner will be announced at a ceremony in London on May 20.\n"},"line_number":20,"absolute_offset":2120,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":13,"end":39}]}}
{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.bc.edu/Daniel Bowles longlisted for International Booker Prize.txt"},"lines":{"text":"For more about the International Booker Prize, including an excerpt from Eurotrash, visit the International Booker Prize website."},"line_number":22,"absolute_offset":2268,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":19,"end":45},{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":94,"end":120}]}}
