{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"fivebooks.com/The Best of World Literature The 2022 International Booker Prize Shortlist.txt"},"lines":{"text":"title: The Best of World Literature: The 2022 International Booker Prize Shortlist\n"},"line_number":2,"absolute_offset":4,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":46,"end":72}]}}
{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"fivebooks.com/The Best of World Literature The 2022 International Booker Prize Shortlist.txt"},"lines":{"text":"The International Booker Prize celebrates the best fiction in translation published over the previous year. Frank Wynne, acclaimed translator and chair of the 2022 judging panel, tells Five Books about the six novels that made the shortlist, and reminds readers that world literature need not be tough, consumed only in the interests of self-improvement—but is often joyful, surprising and full of feeling.\n"},"line_number":6,"absolute_offset":149,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":4,"end":30}]}}
{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"fivebooks.com/The Best of World Literature The 2022 International Booker Prize Shortlist.txt"},"lines":{"text":"Each year, the International Booker Prize is awarded to the best work of fiction newly translated into English. The 2022 shortlist offers a great entry point for readers interested in world literature. Could you talk us through what you, as judges, have been looking for—do you judge a work of translated fiction any differently to a non-translated book?\n"},"line_number":8,"absolute_offset":559,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":15,"end":41}]}}
{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"fivebooks.com/The Best of World Literature The 2022 International Booker Prize Shortlist.txt"},"lines":{"text":"The winner of the 2022 International Booker Prize for the best work of fiction in translation is Tomb of Sand by Geetanjali Shree, translated from the original Hindi by Daisy Rockwell.\n"},"line_number":24,"absolute_offset":3724,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"International Booker Prize"},"start":23,"end":49}]}}
